ience is a key criterion.\n\nThus we might shift recommendation to Candidate B as the current leading option, but we need to still discuss A and D later. Provide reasoning.\n\nWe need to reference prior discussion: agree with Agent 2 that cooperation concerns for C are significant. Bring in evidence: C is unfriendly, not good at taking criticism, unorganized. Also note health (eats unhealthily) could affect stamina. Meanwhile B is very conscientious, handles stress well, good at weather, but has some communication tone issues (wrong tone) and pretentiousness. Argue that B's strengths in reliability and stress resilience outweigh his communication concerns, which can be mitigated.\n\nThus vote for Candidate B.\n\nNow produce PUBLIC_MESSAGE and METADATA_JSON."}
